   {
    "title": "Agentic AI Document Automation",
    "description": "- Architected and developed a scalable, agentic AI system for autonomous data extraction and classification from diverse PDF documents, using LLM-based reasoning to handle variable document structures and enable dynamic decision-making\n- Engineered modular, fault-tolerant data pipelines that integrate OCR, layout analysis, and prompt-based extraction to adaptively process semi-structured and scanned PDFs, improving automation reliability across diverse document formats\n- Implemented a hybrid classification engine leveraging both rule-based and LLM classifiers to accurately detect document types and route extracted data to Excel or Google Sheets for streamlined reporting workflows\n- Shipped a CLI application that demonstrates real-world automation and intelligent document understanding, showcasing a robust and resilient solution for repetitive office task automation and data processing",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Apr 2025 - Apr 2025"
   },
   {
    "title": "Movie Recommendation System",
    "description": "- Developed a web-based movie recommendation system that provides personalized recommendations using collaborative and content-based filtering techniques.\n- Implemented feedback-based interactions for users to like or dislike movies, dynamically updating recommendations and excluding disliked movies.\n- Integrated the OMDb API to fetch movie metadata and posters, enhancing the visual of the recommendations.\n- Enhanced user experience with responsive UI, interactive buttons, and grid layouts styled using CSS.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jan 2025 - Jan 2025"
